@Project_AI_HostAddress = http://localhost:8080
@FrontendOrigin = http://localhost:3000
@Email = your-email@example.com
@Password = Replace-With!StrongPassword2026
@NewPassword = Replace-With!NewStrongPassword2026
@AccessToken = paste-access-token-here
@UserId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@EmailToken = paste-token-from-email-link-here
@ResetToken = paste-token-from-password-reset-link-here
@MailboxId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@EmailId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

GET {{Project_AI_HostAddress}}/health/ready

###

POST {{Project_AI_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Origin: {{FrontendOrigin}}
X-InboxAgent-CSRF: 1
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"{{Email}}","password":"{{Password}}","displayName":"InboxAgent User"}

###
POST {{Project_AI_HostAddress}}/api/auth/confirm-email
Origin: {{FrontendOrigin}}
X-InboxAgent-CSRF: 1
Content-Type: application/json

{"userId":"{{UserId}}","token":"{{EmailToken}}"}

###
POST {{Project_AI_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Origin: {{FrontendOrigin}}
X-InboxAgent-CSRF: 1
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"{{Email}}","password":"{{Password}}"}

### Client cần cookie jar để nhận và gửi HttpOnly refresh cookie.
POST {{Project_AI_HostAddress}}/api/auth/refresh
Origin: {{FrontendOrigin}}
X-InboxAgent-CSRF: 1

###
GET {{Project_AI_HostAddress}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{AccessToken}}

###
POST {{Project_AI_HostAddress}}/api/auth/forgot-password
Origin: {{FrontendOrigin}}
X-InboxAgent-CSRF: 1
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"{{Email}}"}

###
POST {{Project_AI_HostAddress}}/api/auth/resend-confirmation
Origin: {{FrontendOrigin}}
X-InboxAgent-CSRF: 1
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"{{Email}}"}

### Dùng token từ link reset password, không dùng token xác nhận email.
POST {{Project_AI_HostAddress}}/api/auth/reset-password
Origin: {{FrontendOrigin}}
X-InboxAgent-CSRF: 1
Content-Type: application/json

{"userId":"{{UserId}}","token":"{{ResetToken}}","newPassword":"{{NewPassword}}"}

###
POST {{Project_AI_HostAddress}}/api/auth/logout
Origin: {{FrontendOrigin}}
X-InboxAgent-CSRF: 1
Authorization: Bearer {{AccessToken}}

###
POST {{Project_AI_HostAddress}}/api/auth/logout-all
Origin: {{FrontendOrigin}}
X-InboxAgent-CSRF: 1
Authorization: Bearer {{AccessToken}}

### Cần login lại sau khi được cấp role Admin.
GET {{Project_AI_HostAddress}}/api/admin/status
Authorization: Bearer {{AccessToken}}

### Mailboxes của người đang đăng nhập; không trả Google token.
GET {{Project_AI_HostAddress}}/api/mailboxes
Authorization: Bearer {{AccessToken}}

### Tham khảo docs/gmail-oauth.md để bắt đầu OAuth từ browser giữ được cookie callback.
POST {{Project_AI_HostAddress}}/api/mailboxes/gmail/connect
Origin: {{FrontendOrigin}}
X-InboxAgent-CSRF: 1
Authorization: Bearer {{AccessToken}}

### Xóa credentials Gmail lưu local và vô hiệu callback đang chờ.
POST {{Project_AI_HostAddress}}/api/mailboxes/gmail/disconnect
Origin: {{FrontendOrigin}}
X-InboxAgent-CSRF: 1
Authorization: Bearer {{AccessToken}}

### Lấy MailboxId từ GET /api/mailboxes; mailbox cần connected.
POST {{Project_AI_HostAddress}}/api/mailboxes/{{MailboxId}}/sync
Origin: {{FrontendOrigin}}
X-InboxAgent-CSRF: 1
Authorization: Bearer {{AccessToken}}

### Trạng thái đồng bộ lần gần nhất.
GET {{Project_AI_HostAddress}}/api/mailboxes/{{MailboxId}}/sync
Authorization: Bearer {{AccessToken}}

### Cache Inbox mới nhất trước, pageSize tối đa 100.
GET {{Project_AI_HostAddress}}/api/mailboxes/{{MailboxId}}/emails?page=1&pageSize=20&unreadOnly=false
Authorization: Bearer {{AccessToken}}

### EmailId là id local từ items trong response danh sách.
GET {{Project_AI_HostAddress}}/api/mailboxes/{{MailboxId}}/emails/{{EmailId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{AccessToken}}
